Subject: [PATCH v10 03/10] jails/instances/lab-mail: Keep the list in INBOX
To: Pat Maddox <pat@patmaddox.com>
Cc: lab-devel@p7x.dev
Change-Id: rlxvpnnwlozmnxnwknyksoqukkvvurxy
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 17:41:41 +0000

The list has a Fastmail account of its own, so nothing but list mail
arrives in it and there is nothing to sort. Filing posts into a lists
folder, by a Fastmail rule and on lab-mail, only adds a step between
a post and its readers. Pat also needs room on Fastmail for folders
that are not the list, without them reaching lab-mail or any client.

- Posts land in INBOX, on Fastmail and on lab-mail, and the rule and
  the lists folder go.
- lab-mail syncs INBOX and Archive and no other folder.
- The moderation queue that INBOX was kept free for goes too.
